  {
    "page_number": 13,
    "blocks": [
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev_p13_b174",
        "type": "heading",
        "section_path": [],
        "bbox": [
          0.3611,
          0.066,
          0.6454,
          0.0787
        ],
        "text": "NASA-STD-8739.14 - 2020-06-02"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev_p13_b175",
        "type": "list",
        "section_path": [],
        "bbox": [
          0.2281,
          0.0984,
          0.6901,
          0.1115
        ],
        "text": "Fasteners shall be procured in homogeneous lots."
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev_p13_b176",
        "type": "list",
        "section_path": [],
        "bbox": [
          0.2281,
          0.131,
          0.8494,
          0.1441
        ],
        "text": "Commingling of lots shall not occur in order to ensure lot traceability."
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev_p13_b177",
        "type": "list",
        "section_path": [],
        "bbox": [
          0.2281,
          0.1636,
          0.8713,
          0.1941
        ],
        "text": "The criteria for complete traceability of each fastener lot shall include all of the following:"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev_p13_b178",
        "type": "list",
        "section_path": [],
        "bbox": [
          0.1471,
          0.2136,
          0.8453,
          0.2441
        ],
        "text": "Documentation showing all transfers of custody from the original raw material manufacturer through the original part manufacturer, including unique lot/heat numbers."
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev_p13_b179",
        "type": "list",
        "section_path": [],
        "bbox": [
          0.1471,
          0.2636,
          0.8499,
          0.2941
        ],
        "text": "Documentation for all transfers of custody from the original part manufacturer to any intermediate manufacturers and distributors and the final supplier."
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev_p13_b180",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "section_path": [],
        "bbox": [
          0.1765,
          0.3136,
          0.7612,
          0.3441
        ],
        "text": "Note: Traceability documentation that does not meet all of the criteria for complete traceability is considered incomplete traceability."
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev_p13_b181",
        "type": "list",
        "section_path": [],
        "bbox": [
          0.2281,
          0.3637,
          0.8036,
          0.3941
        ],
        "text": "Traceability documentation shall be maintained by the hardware developer."
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev_p13_b182",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "section_path": [],
        "bbox": [
          0.1765,
          0.4136,
          0.8808,
          0.4441
        ],
        "text": "Note: Bolts are often marked with identifying characteristics including the material symbol, manufacturer's symbol, and lot number as space allows to facilitate traceability."
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev_p13_b183",
        "type": "heading",
        "section_path": [],
        "bbox": [
          0.1177,
          0.4637,
          0.4607,
          0.4767
        ],
        "text": "4.4.3 Certificate of Conformance (CoC)"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev_p13_b184",
        "type": "list",
        "section_path": [],
        "bbox": [
          0.2281,
          0.4962,
          0.8782,
          0.5441
        ],
        "text": "Level I, II and III fasteners shall be procured with a Certificate of Conformance (CoC) that references the applicable technical specifications and the supplier."
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev_p13_b185",
        "type": "heading",
        "section_path": [],
        "bbox": [
          0.1177,
          0.5637,
          0.4694,
          0.5767
        ],
        "text": "4.4.4 Manufacturer's Test Report (MTR)"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev_p13_b186",
        "type": "list",
        "section_path": [],
        "bbox": [
          0.2281,
          0.5963,
          0.8385,
          0.6267
        ],
        "text": "Level I and II fasteners shall be procured with a Manufacturer's Test Report (MTR). The MTR is optional for level III fasteners"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev_p13_b187",
        "type": "heading",
        "section_path": [],
        "bbox": [
          0.1177,
          0.6468,
          0.3699,
          0.6595
        ],
        "text": "4.5 Receiving Inspection"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev_p13_b188",
        "type": "list",
        "section_path": [],
        "bbox": [
          0.1177,
          0.6814,
          0.8852,
          0.7467
        ],
        "text": "Fastener lots shall have receiving inspection and testing performed by an entity whose quality management system is in compliance with, or registered to, an appropriate ISO or equivalent standard (e.g., ISO 17025:2017, General Requirements for the Competence of Testing and Calibration Laboratories, ISO 9001:2015, AS9100D, etc.)."
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev_p13_b189",
        "type": "list",
        "section_path": [],
        "bbox": [
          0.1177,
          0.7663,
          0.8836,
          0.8316
        ],
        "text": "Fastener lots shall be verified by inspection and tests as required in this section and summarized in Table 1.  When these inspections and tests are performed on a sampling basis, the required sampling size (A, B, or C) is identified in Table 1 and the corresponding sampling quantity is called out in Table 2."
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev_p13_b190",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "section_path": [],
        "bbox": [
          0.1765,
          0.8511,
          0.8687,
          0.899
        ],
        "text": "Note: These inspections/tests are performed upon receipt of the fasteners and is in addition to those performed by the fastener manufacturer. Their purpose is to verify the quality of the fastener lot and the integrity of the delivered documentation."
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev_p13_b191",
        "type": "footer",
        "section_path": [],
        "bbox": [
          0.4458,
          0.9405,
          0.5591,
          0.9536
        ],
        "text": "Page 13 of 16"
      }
    ],
    "tables": []
